WEBVTT

00:17.393 --> 00:19.018
Previously on From...

00:19.019 --> 00:22.897
Boyd, are you seriously okay
with him taking magic mushrooms

00:22.898 --> 00:25.108
that he found
in a haunted forest?

00:25.109 --> 00:26.735
If there are answers
in his head,

00:26.736 --> 00:28.862
we need to get them out.
Okay are you ready for this?

00:28.863 --> 00:31.030
Fuck no.

00:31.031 --> 00:33.158
She's making a golem.

00:33.159 --> 00:34.909
It's a giant made of clay.

00:34.910 --> 00:36.953
It protects people.
It's a champion.

00:36.954 --> 00:39.664
That thing I carried inside me,
I still feel it.

00:39.665 --> 00:41.499
It goes both ways.

00:41.500 --> 00:43.251
He feels how afraid I am.

00:43.252 --> 00:47.046
But making this,
it makes me feel strong.

00:47.047 --> 00:49.758
I thought
his yellow suit was funny.

00:49.759 --> 00:52.051
He came in a car,
just like the rest of us.

00:52.052 --> 00:54.137
But he wasn't like us.

00:54.138 --> 00:56.848
When I found Mom out by
the bottle tree, I saw him.

00:58.851 --> 01:00.518
He was eating her.

01:00.519 --> 01:02.687
Oh, my God. Oh, God.

01:08.402 --> 01:10.695
I can't imagine
what this is like for her.

01:11.822 --> 01:12.822
- Wait!
- I'm coming!

01:12.823 --> 01:14.157
Don't move, okay?

01:14.158 --> 01:15.658
Where does it hurt?

01:15.659 --> 01:17.118
I hurt my arm.

01:17.119 --> 01:19.204
This could actually be
an instruction manual

01:19.205 --> 01:21.164
on how to save my Dad.

01:29.006 --> 01:31.841
Fuck! It didn't fucking work!

01:31.842 --> 01:33.676
I need to find
the Lake of Tears.

01:33.677 --> 01:35.845
My Dad told me it's here.

01:35.846 --> 01:37.848
Maybe once I find it,
it can make him better.

01:42.186 --> 01:43.646
Mom?

01:57.243 --> 01:59.370
I'm telling you,
those are bodies.

02:00.830 --> 02:02.705
We should pull 'em in.

02:02.706 --> 02:04.207
Are you insane?

02:04.208 --> 02:06.417
Something floats up from
the bottom of Nightmare Lake

02:06.418 --> 02:08.461
and the first thing you
wanna do is drag it ashore?

02:08.462 --> 02:09.879
You may run things

02:09.880 --> 02:12.131
back at Colony House,
but we all get a say here.

02:12.132 --> 02:15.009
Look, we have
to sleep here tonight.

02:15.010 --> 02:17.470
Even if we took off
running right now,

02:17.471 --> 02:19.556
we'd never make it
back to town before dark.

02:19.557 --> 02:21.891
I don't know about you, but I
would feel a whole lot better

02:21.892 --> 02:23.685
knowing who or what

02:23.686 --> 02:26.229
just floated to the
surface of this lake.

02:26.230 --> 02:27.690
She's right.

02:31.360 --> 02:33.111
You're quiet.

02:33.112 --> 02:34.655
What do you think?

02:37.700 --> 02:39.450
Let's pull 'em in.

02:41.620 --> 02:42.745
Come on!

02:56.260 --> 02:57.469
I got it.

03:00.514 --> 03:01.599
Jeez.

03:11.066 --> 03:12.234
Now what?

03:14.153 --> 03:16.113
Get it up on land.

03:17.239 --> 03:18.532
Okay.

03:39.970 --> 03:42.348
I'm sorry
we couldn't save you.

03:50.272 --> 03:52.650
I really wanted it
to be the Lake of Tears.

03:55.486 --> 03:56.695
I know.

03:59.949 --> 04:00.866
Mom?

04:01.951 --> 04:03.326
Yeah?

04:03.327 --> 04:04.912
Are we gonna be okay?

04:09.041 --> 04:10.417
I hope so.

04:23.764 --> 04:24.765
Hey, Boyd.

04:28.644 --> 04:29.770
Boyd?

04:31.271 --> 04:33.607
I think the mushrooms
kicked in.

04:34.817 --> 04:36.985
Jade?

04:36.986 --> 04:38.737
It's a little more
direct than I expected.

04:40.531 --> 04:41.614
Okay.

04:43.367 --> 04:44.618
Ah.

04:49.915 --> 04:51.416
Ahh! Oh, Jesus!

04:51.417 --> 04:52.542
-  Oh!
- Fuck! Aah!

04:52.543 --> 04:53.668
Oh! Jade! Whoa! Whoa!

04:53.669 --> 04:56.212
Jade! Jade!
Whoa! Whoa! Whoa! Hey!

04:56.213 --> 04:57.922
Look, there's nothing there.

04:57.923 --> 04:59.298
Nothing there.

04:59.299 --> 05:01.884
Oh, God.

05:01.885 --> 05:03.345
This may not have been
such a great idea.

05:04.888 --> 05:06.848
Oh!

05:06.849 --> 05:09.892
Hey, maybe we just-- maybe we go
see Kristi and we just--

05:09.893 --> 05:11.185
Oh...

05:11.186 --> 05:13.980
No, no. No. No.

05:13.981 --> 05:16.107
I have to do this.
I have to do this.

05:16.108 --> 05:18.151
But I need you.

05:18.152 --> 05:21.738
I need you to be
my anchor, my guide.

05:21.739 --> 05:24.241
You need to tell me what's real
and, you know, what isn't.

05:26.243 --> 05:28.619
And we need a safe word,
something that you can say

05:28.620 --> 05:30.621
if things start to,
you know, go off the rails;

05:30.622 --> 05:33.250
something that'll...
bring me back.

05:35.169 --> 05:36.920
Okay, safe word.

05:38.213 --> 05:39.840
What's it gonna be?

05:46.430 --> 05:47.514
Capricorn.

05:48.932 --> 05:51.184
Capricorn? Okay.

05:51.185 --> 05:52.268
Yeah.

05:52.269 --> 05:55.105
Okay.

06:00.319 --> 06:01.612
Let's go get weird.

06:03.030 --> 06:04.031
All right.

06:13.624 --> 06:16.000
All right,
where do we start?

06:16.001 --> 06:17.460
We go this way.

06:24.802 --> 06:27.011
You just take
nice deep breaths, okay?

06:27.012 --> 06:28.137
You're gonna do great.

06:28.138 --> 06:30.348
- 'Kay, ready?
- Wait, wait, wait.

06:30.349 --> 06:31.849
May-- Maybe we don't
have to do this. I mean...

06:31.850 --> 06:34.018
maybe we should wait.
It doesn't--

06:34.019 --> 06:36.104
it really doesn't hurt
nearly as much as it did.

06:36.105 --> 06:38.940
I know you're scared, but
if we don't reset this bone,

06:38.941 --> 06:41.025
you're not gonna heal properly,

06:41.026 --> 06:43.111
and then, we're gonna
have much bigger problems

06:43.112 --> 06:44.654
than we can
handle here, okay?

06:44.655 --> 06:46.781
Okay.

06:46.782 --> 06:48.908
Just breathe.

06:48.909 --> 06:51.537
Okay.
We'll go on the count of three.

06:52.704 --> 06:55.414
And I need you to take
a nice, big deep breath in.

06:55.415 --> 06:56.833
Ready?

06:56.834 --> 06:57.959
Big breath.

06:59.378 --> 07:01.170
One...

07:02.381 --> 07:04.173
Sorry. I know
that was the worst part.

07:04.174 --> 07:06.175
I just thought it'd be
better if we did it quick.

07:06.176 --> 07:07.510
You're okay.

07:07.511 --> 07:09.470
Do you have
the brace?

07:09.471 --> 07:11.639
No, it's in the ambulance.
I'll be right back.

07:11.640 --> 07:12.807
You did great.

07:17.688 --> 07:19.480
Hey, you cut your hair.

07:19.481 --> 07:20.857
It looks nice.

07:20.858 --> 07:22.650
Thanks.

07:22.651 --> 07:24.027
It's a long story.

08:12.159 --> 08:17.038
♪ When I was just a little boy ♪

08:17.039 --> 08:19.498
♪ I asked my father ♪

08:19.499 --> 08:21.084
♪ "What will I be?" ♪

08:23.170 --> 08:25.630
♪ "Will I be handsome?" ♪

08:25.631 --> 08:28.090
♪ "Will I be rich?" ♪

08:28.091 --> 08:32.136
♪ Here's what he said to me ♪

08:32.137 --> 08:34.640
♪ Que sera sera ♪

08:36.308 --> 08:39.519
♪ Whatever will be will be ♪

08:41.188 --> 08:45.316
♪ The future's not ours to see ♪

08:45.317 --> 08:48.070
♪ Que sera sera ♪

08:50.364 --> 08:53.242
♪ What will be will be ♪

09:02.668 --> 09:07.588
♪ Now I have
children of my own ♪

09:07.589 --> 09:10.007
♪ They ask their father ♪

09:10.008 --> 09:13.719
♪ "What will I be?" ♪

09:13.720 --> 09:16.264
♪ "Will I be pretty?" ♪

09:16.265 --> 09:18.683
♪ "Will I be rich?" ♪

09:18.684 --> 09:21.019
♪ I tell them tenderly ♪

09:22.688 --> 09:25.232
♪ Que sera sera ♪

09:26.817 --> 09:29.987
♪ Whatever will be will be ♪

09:31.822 --> 09:35.825
♪ The future's not ours to see ♪

09:35.826 --> 09:38.245
♪ Que sera sera ♪

09:40.872 --> 09:43.792
♪ What will be will be ♪

09:46.086 --> 09:48.922
♪ Que sera sera ♪

10:16.325 --> 10:17.409
They're dolls.

10:20.537 --> 10:21.580
Jesus.

10:37.179 --> 10:38.387
What are you doing?

10:38.388 --> 10:40.557
Making sure there's
no more surprises.

11:03.330 --> 11:05.540
Why would someone
put those in the lake?

11:13.423 --> 11:15.049
Shit.

11:15.050 --> 11:16.051
What?

11:18.720 --> 11:20.763
There's only one reason
I can think of

11:20.764 --> 11:24.226
that people put life-sized
dolls full of stuffing outside.

11:26.228 --> 11:28.270
Scarecrows.

11:28.271 --> 11:31.608
You put them in the field
to scare the birds away.

11:33.276 --> 11:36.320
What if the reason
these were in the lake

11:36.321 --> 11:39.240
is to keep
something else down there...

11:39.241 --> 11:41.326
from coming out?

12:09.479 --> 12:11.648
Oh.

12:13.066 --> 12:14.608
You okay?

12:15.861 --> 12:17.903
Yeah. I'm okay.

12:17.904 --> 12:19.238
I'm okay.

12:19.239 --> 12:20.823
So, uh...
So, what now?

12:31.418 --> 12:33.502
Jade!

12:33.503 --> 12:34.670
What?

12:34.671 --> 12:36.839
What exactly
is the plan?

12:36.840 --> 12:38.799
What? Do we just walk
around the forest all day,

12:38.800 --> 12:40.551
waiting for the trees
to start talking?

12:40.552 --> 12:42.219
What are we looking for?

12:43.972 --> 12:45.264
You're right.

12:45.265 --> 12:46.390
Oh!

12:46.391 --> 12:47.725
About what?

12:47.726 --> 12:50.186
I haven't asked the question!
We need to ask...

12:50.187 --> 12:53.272
the right question,

12:53.273 --> 12:55.775
set the-
the right intention.

12:57.486 --> 12:58.904
Okay, I got this.

13:02.324 --> 13:04.576
Show me what I used to know...

13:06.828 --> 13:08.830
...that I can't remember.

13:11.917 --> 13:14.794
Show me what's in here
that'll help us leave.

13:21.760 --> 13:23.302
Do you hear that?

13:24.971 --> 13:26.472
No.

13:53.542 --> 13:55.125
Oh, God.

13:55.126 --> 13:57.420
What's wrong?
What do you see?

13:58.964 --> 14:00.839
Something I'd forgotten.

14:03.260 --> 14:08.055
It's me when
I was 12 years-old.

14:08.056 --> 14:09.099
It's the day
my grandmother died.

14:11.935 --> 14:13.894
I don't understand.

14:13.895 --> 14:16.105
She asked me to
play for her, so I-I did.

14:16.106 --> 14:19.150
I...
I played all day.

14:21.194 --> 14:23.571
And at some point, I...

14:23.572 --> 14:26.865
I knew she--

14:26.866 --> 14:29.952
she just wasn't
in the room anymore.

14:32.789 --> 14:37.710
But I couldn't look at her;
I just kept playing,

14:37.711 --> 14:41.171
'cause I knew,
the moment I stopped,

14:41.172 --> 14:43.215
she was really gone.

14:43.216 --> 14:46.594
So, I just
played and played and played.

14:48.805 --> 14:50.264
Goddammit! God!

14:50.265 --> 14:52.850
Goddammit,
this isn't what I asked for!

14:52.851 --> 14:55.853
I wanna remember
why we're stuck here!

14:55.854 --> 14:57.396
I wanna remember
how to get home!

14:57.397 --> 14:58.731
- I don't want this!
- No, hey,

14:58.732 --> 15:00.233
Jade, Jade, Jade, Jade.

15:01.401 --> 15:03.193
It's okay.

15:03.194 --> 15:04.403
I wanna go back.

15:04.404 --> 15:08.073
I just wanna go back!
I wanna go back!

15:08.074 --> 15:09.284
Oh, shit.

15:10.994 --> 15:12.037
How did you get here?

15:13.663 --> 15:14.955
Jade?

15:16.958 --> 15:18.292
Oh, Jesus!

15:18.293 --> 15:19.918
Jade?

15:21.296 --> 15:23.464
Talk to me.

15:23.465 --> 15:26.176
He-- It's the guy from...

15:30.972 --> 15:32.014
Fuck!

15:32.015 --> 15:33.724
Where is he?

15:33.725 --> 15:35.601
Where did he go?
He was-- huh?

15:35.602 --> 15:36.853
Anghkooey.

15:38.521 --> 15:39.481
Jade!

15:41.066 --> 15:42.232
Anghkooey.

15:43.943 --> 15:45.444
I fucking heard you!

15:47.238 --> 15:49.991
Stop.
Stop playing that song!

15:53.787 --> 15:55.163
Jade?

15:56.623 --> 15:58.375
I'm gonna need an update.

16:01.753 --> 16:05.422
Some asshole I saw nailed to
a tree out at the settlement

16:05.423 --> 16:08.050
wants me to drink the same
skull of blood he's been

16:08.051 --> 16:09.719
schlepping around
with him since we met!

16:11.137 --> 16:13.305
- And he keeps saying...
- Anghkooey.

16:13.306 --> 16:15.140
Doesn't that mean "remember"?

16:15.141 --> 16:16.225
Yes!

16:16.226 --> 16:17.811
So, drink it!

16:19.187 --> 16:20.729
Easy for you to say.

16:20.730 --> 16:22.731
Jade?

16:22.732 --> 16:24.192
The blood is not real.

16:28.613 --> 16:30.656
Well, it looks real enough.

16:30.657 --> 16:34.369
Hey, maybe he's trying to tell
you how to get your answers.

16:37.330 --> 16:39.123
Anghkooey.

16:39.124 --> 16:40.083
Don't drink it.

16:41.501 --> 16:42.460
What?

16:45.839 --> 16:46.715
Jade...

16:48.508 --> 16:49.467
...the blood isn't real.

16:50.969 --> 16:52.595
Goddammit.

17:14.617 --> 17:15.827
You good?

17:43.855 --> 17:48.109
Hey, whoa, whoa, whoa.
Hey! What's-- what's-- Jade!

17:53.782 --> 17:54.741
Come in.

17:58.161 --> 17:59.370
Hey.

18:00.663 --> 18:02.790
Wow!

18:02.791 --> 18:05.542
I'm really, uh...

18:05.543 --> 18:07.253
I'm starting
to see the shape now.

18:08.880 --> 18:10.006
Did you need something?

18:11.800 --> 18:13.926
Yeah, I, uh...

18:13.927 --> 18:14.969
I just--

18:17.305 --> 18:18.890
I wanted to say I'm sorry.

18:20.433 --> 18:22.851
Earlier,
I should have tried to...

18:22.852 --> 18:25.479
listen more,
instead of reacting.

18:25.480 --> 18:28.774
We're strongest when
we back each other up,

18:28.775 --> 18:30.692
and I was not doing that.

18:30.693 --> 18:32.778
I got scared

18:32.779 --> 18:35.656
and I should've,
uh, backed you up.

18:35.657 --> 18:37.658
That's all.

18:37.659 --> 18:38.743
Thank you, Kenny.

18:44.082 --> 18:45.875
Was there something else?

18:49.879 --> 18:51.714
It's okay, you can ask.

18:52.882 --> 18:54.968
You said you were still
connected to that thing.

19:00.765 --> 19:02.976
What does that feel like?

19:06.062 --> 19:09.314
Terrifying...

19:09.315 --> 19:12.360
in a way I can't
really explain.

19:14.112 --> 19:15.488
Every night, I...

19:17.991 --> 19:20.200
...I go to that window,

19:20.201 --> 19:21.618
and I look outside,

19:21.619 --> 19:23.829
knowing that,
one of these nights,

19:23.830 --> 19:25.248
I'm gonna see him
standing there...

19:27.083 --> 19:28.918
...staring back at me.

19:32.297 --> 19:33.798
What happens then?

19:37.468 --> 19:38.720
I don't know.

19:45.143 --> 19:47.687
Listen, if you need, um--
if you need anything...

19:49.314 --> 19:50.815
Thank you, Kenny.

20:05.038 --> 20:06.872
Henry.

20:06.873 --> 20:08.708
Uh, Kenny, hey.

20:10.460 --> 20:11.919
Is that from the bar?

20:11.920 --> 20:14.379
Yeah, I just, uh...

20:14.380 --> 20:17.507
I keep a little stash
on hand, you know,

20:17.508 --> 20:20.385
just to take the edge off.

20:20.386 --> 20:21.511
Okay.

20:21.512 --> 20:22.763
Oh, help yourself.

20:22.764 --> 20:24.766
No, thanks.
I'm good.

20:36.611 --> 20:38.070
Hey.

20:38.071 --> 20:39.530
What's taking so long?

20:43.701 --> 20:45.452
Did you find the splint?

20:45.453 --> 20:46.371
Hey.

20:48.456 --> 20:49.499
What's wrong?

20:51.250 --> 20:53.001
Um...

20:53.002 --> 20:55.672
Uh, I'm fine.
Yeah, I just needed a minute.

20:56.798 --> 20:57.840
Found it.

20:59.676 --> 21:01.635
- I'm fine.
- Baby...

21:01.636 --> 21:02.886
Hey!

21:02.887 --> 21:04.554
- I'm fine, okay?
- You're not fine!

21:04.555 --> 21:06.473
Kristi, leave it.
I'm good.

21:06.474 --> 21:07.641
Fuck.

21:14.607 --> 21:15.857
Just, once in a while, I...

21:15.858 --> 21:17.943
stop and think about
the types of things

21:17.944 --> 21:19.486
that have become
normal for us.

21:19.487 --> 21:22.823
I mean, we're sitting here,
packing life-sized dolls

21:22.824 --> 21:25.492
full of rocks because
we think that they're gonna...

21:25.493 --> 21:28.954
Take my advice:
stop thinking about it.

21:28.955 --> 21:31.206
Think about somethin' else.

21:31.207 --> 21:33.750
Think about getting
back to your wife.

21:33.751 --> 21:35.628
We need to get these
fuckers back in the water.

21:41.551 --> 21:43.720
Do you really think there's
something bad in the water?

21:45.263 --> 21:47.515
I think I'd rather
not find out.

21:49.308 --> 21:50.393
Thanks.

22:03.823 --> 22:06.576
Tabitha, uh, can you
help me with something?

22:08.411 --> 22:09.412
Yeah.

22:11.998 --> 22:13.416
- Over here.
- Yeah.

22:20.882 --> 22:24.301
Okay, I saw that
look on your face.

22:24.302 --> 22:25.762
What's going on?

22:27.305 --> 22:29.973
Something about
those dolls j--

22:29.974 --> 22:31.975
I don't know,
it was familiar.

22:31.976 --> 22:33.477
I don't know.

22:33.478 --> 22:35.437
- Good familiar or bad familiar?
- I don't know!

22:35.438 --> 22:36.481
I don't-- don't know.

22:39.150 --> 22:41.109
I think I've
seen them before.

22:41.110 --> 22:44.029
Okay. Try, try to remember.

22:44.030 --> 22:46.656
I'm trying, Donna!
I'm try-- I'm trying.

22:46.657 --> 22:49.326
All I see are, like, little
pieces and their faces and...

22:49.327 --> 22:51.578
It's-- It's weird, huh?

22:51.579 --> 22:55.458
Is there something in that lake
that we need to be afraid of?

22:59.253 --> 23:01.254
I don't know.

23:01.255 --> 23:02.964
We're ready to
drag 'em back in.

23:02.965 --> 23:04.383
Okay, let's do it.

23:07.762 --> 23:09.012
Just grab 'em.

23:09.013 --> 23:10.138
Okay.

23:10.139 --> 23:11.306
Okay.

23:13.768 --> 23:14.893
Come on.

23:14.894 --> 23:15.977
Yep.

23:15.978 --> 23:19.231
Careful, Patty.
Careful.

23:19.232 --> 23:20.149
Yeah.

23:21.526 --> 23:22.443
Whoa!

24:03.317 --> 24:06.319
Hey...
Hey, what does that mean?

24:06.320 --> 24:08.781
That I'm gonna see things
that I don't wanna see, huh?

24:10.366 --> 24:11.408
Hey.

24:11.409 --> 24:13.785
Answer me.

24:13.786 --> 24:16.955
Hey!

24:21.669 --> 24:22.795
Hello?

24:26.632 --> 24:28.009
Hey, Boyd, did you...?

24:30.052 --> 24:32.345
Boyd?

24:32.346 --> 24:33.264
Boyd!

24:34.682 --> 24:36.141
Don't do that.

24:36.142 --> 24:38.018
Don't fucking
leave me like that.

24:38.019 --> 24:39.477
I didn't.

24:39.478 --> 24:40.730
I've been here
the whole time.

24:42.064 --> 24:43.356
Hey...

24:43.357 --> 24:45.525
are you good?

24:45.526 --> 24:48.320
Yeah, I'm--
I'm-- I'm good.

24:48.321 --> 24:50.071
You're sure?

24:50.072 --> 24:51.948
Jade, we can stop.

24:51.949 --> 24:53.576
If this is too much,
we can still go back.

25:00.750 --> 25:02.542
This way.

25:02.543 --> 25:04.294
Jade.

25:04.295 --> 25:06.004
Jade!
Shit.

25:49.298 --> 25:52.510
Boyd...
where are we?

25:54.178 --> 25:56.429
We're outside
Colony House.

25:57.807 --> 25:59.724
What do you see?

25:59.725 --> 26:01.476
I warned you.

26:01.477 --> 26:05.397
The answers you sought come
wrapped in painful truths.

26:16.575 --> 26:17.826
Dad?

26:19.036 --> 26:21.997
Dad?

26:21.998 --> 26:23.498
I-I don't think you should
look at that anymore.

26:23.499 --> 26:26.376
Ah!
I just, uh-- I--

26:26.377 --> 26:28.254
I just...

26:30.965 --> 26:33.842
What-- What--
What do you do here...

26:33.843 --> 26:35.176
for-- for fun?

26:35.177 --> 26:36.678
What?

26:36.679 --> 26:39.973
Well, there's so much time
just sitting around,

26:39.974 --> 26:42.183
worrying if you're
gonna survive the night.

26:42.184 --> 26:44.102
You can't forget to live.

26:44.103 --> 26:48.648
You-- You have to live, son.

26:48.649 --> 26:50.650
Come on, let's-- let's--

26:50.651 --> 26:52.152
Whoa!

26:52.153 --> 26:55.238
No, I'm fine.
I'm okay. Just, just...

26:55.239 --> 26:56.364
Dad?

26:56.365 --> 26:58.116
Just...

26:58.117 --> 26:59.035
Dad!

27:03.497 --> 27:05.206
You got any cards?

27:05.207 --> 27:06.875
What?

27:06.876 --> 27:09.127
Cards. To-- to play.
You got cards?

27:09.128 --> 27:10.170
Dad.

27:10.171 --> 27:11.421
Maybe in the kitchen.

27:11.422 --> 27:12.464
What are you makin'?

27:12.465 --> 27:14.299
- Uh...
- That's nice!

27:14.300 --> 27:15.383
-  Dad...
- See?

27:15.384 --> 27:17.260
That's--
good for you.

27:17.261 --> 27:19.179
These guys are having fun.

27:19.180 --> 27:20.513
Is he okay?

27:20.514 --> 27:21.598
Yeah.

27:21.599 --> 27:23.892
Does this work?

27:23.893 --> 27:25.894
Ooh, look at that.

27:26.937 --> 27:28.313
Maybe you
should go lie down.

27:28.314 --> 27:31.524
Lie down? I don't wanna
lie down! I wanna...

27:34.278 --> 27:37.113
♪ All my bags are packed ♪

27:37.114 --> 27:39.074
♪ I'm ready to go ♪

27:40.785 --> 27:44.996
♪ I'm standing here,
outside your door ♪

27:44.997 --> 27:48.208
♪ I hate to wake you up ♪

27:48.209 --> 27:49.334
♪ To say goodbye ♪

27:49.335 --> 27:51.503
You remember this one?

27:55.424 --> 28:00.095
♪ So, ki-- kiss me
and smile for me ♪

28:00.096 --> 28:02.430
You-- right? Aah!

28:02.431 --> 28:05.308
♪ Tell me that
you'll wait for me ♪

28:06.811 --> 28:10.814
♪ Hold me like
you'll never let me go ♪

28:10.815 --> 28:11.898
Dad, stop.

28:11.899 --> 28:14.692
You remember
when we used to play?!

28:15.903 --> 28:19.114
We used to sit at
the piano and you would--

28:19.115 --> 28:21.324
I'd give you a note.
That was your note.

28:21.325 --> 28:23.660
And you--
you were so little!

28:23.661 --> 28:26.246
And-- but your mom,

28:26.247 --> 28:29.457
she had such a beautiful voice.
You remember?

28:29.458 --> 28:31.334
- Dad, please.
-  You must remem--

28:31.335 --> 28:34.212
oh, come on! We-- We'd sit there
and we'd talk about

28:34.213 --> 28:36.047
how we'd all go
'round the world someday

28:36.048 --> 28:39.217
and see all the beautiful
things and we'd be...

28:39.218 --> 28:42.720
♪ Leavin' on a jet plane ♪

28:42.721 --> 28:44.806
- Shh!
- Come on!

28:44.807 --> 28:48.811
♪ Don't know when
I'll be back again ♪

28:50.563 --> 28:53.731
♪ Oh, babe, I hate to go ♪

28:57.695 --> 29:01.531
♪ So, kiss me and... ♪

29:01.532 --> 29:05.160
♪ ...smile for me ♪

29:05.161 --> 29:08.956
♪ Tell me that
you'll wait for me ♪

29:11.250 --> 29:14.961
♪ Hold me like you'll
never let me go ♪

29:19.383 --> 29:20.508
Hey, Henry, can we...?

29:20.509 --> 29:23.929
No! No!

29:25.389 --> 29:28.433
Who the fuck
are you to tell me?

29:28.434 --> 29:32.061
Do you know what he did?

29:32.062 --> 29:33.897
What he did to my wife?

29:37.902 --> 29:38.943
Henry, please.

29:38.944 --> 29:40.278
Let's take it upstairs, right?

29:40.279 --> 29:42.113
Vic-- Vic--
Victor, I'm sorry.

29:42.114 --> 29:45.325
I'm sorry.
I didn't mean-- I'm...

29:45.326 --> 29:47.368
I'm sorry. I'm sorry!

29:47.369 --> 29:49.370
- I'm sorry!
-  Okay, okay, okay!

29:49.371 --> 29:52.332
- I'm sorry!
- Okay, let's um-- let's go.

29:52.333 --> 29:54.792
No. No, you-- you--
you don't know--

29:54.793 --> 29:57.086
you don't know what he did.

29:57.087 --> 29:58.838
Victor...
show him the picture.

29:58.839 --> 30:00.840
Show him the picture
of what he did.

30:00.841 --> 30:04.969
What's wrong with you?!

30:04.970 --> 30:07.640
- Show him what he did!
- Okay, okay, okay.

30:34.416 --> 30:37.252
What's the fire for?

30:37.253 --> 30:38.878
Hold on.

30:38.879 --> 30:41.215
You telling me you
didn't bring the marshmallows?

30:42.967 --> 30:44.510
Are we gonna be okay?

30:46.053 --> 30:47.762
Of course we are.

30:47.763 --> 30:50.266
'Cause I don't want
Julie to be alone.

30:52.393 --> 30:54.894
Tell you what,

30:54.895 --> 30:58.147
first thing in the morning,
we're gonna get up,

30:58.148 --> 31:02.236
grab our packs, and
get the heck outta here. Okay?

31:04.113 --> 31:05.572
Go on.

31:05.573 --> 31:06.490
Get in the cabin.

31:09.201 --> 31:11.036
I like it when you're here.

31:12.037 --> 31:13.997
It's just not as scary
when you're around.

31:25.676 --> 31:27.176
Randall.

31:27.177 --> 31:30.138
Listen... Listen.

31:30.139 --> 31:32.223
The one time
you tried doing something

31:32.224 --> 31:36.019
that would have actually proved
it was real, it didn't work!

31:36.020 --> 31:38.730
This isn't about me
or the bookmark.

31:38.731 --> 31:41.524
'Kay? This is about you and you
being scared of those ruins.

31:41.525 --> 31:42.775
Are you serious?

31:42.776 --> 31:44.444
You're a
fucking coward, Randall.

31:44.445 --> 31:46.154
And you're
a stubborn little child

31:46.155 --> 31:48.406
who doesn't know what the
fuck's in front of her face.

31:48.407 --> 31:50.783
Really?
And what is that, huh?

31:50.784 --> 31:52.493
Oh, this place
is fucking with your head

31:52.494 --> 31:54.288
because it knows
how much you miss your dad!

31:56.081 --> 31:59.667
No. You're wrong.

31:59.668 --> 32:02.295
I watched you have
two seizures in two days.

32:02.296 --> 32:04.505
All right? You're literally
frying your own brain.

32:04.506 --> 32:06.382
So, why don't you tell me
what's more likely:

32:06.383 --> 32:08.468
that you're traveling through
chapters of a story

32:08.469 --> 32:10.720
or that one of these days,
you're gonna have a seizure

32:10.721 --> 32:12.305
- that doesn't stop?
- I don't care!

32:12.306 --> 32:13.766
That is a risk
I am willing to take!

32:15.351 --> 32:17.435
Then, you're a moron.

32:17.436 --> 32:20.146
And if your dad was here right
now he'd be fucking stunned

32:20.147 --> 32:22.191
at how goddamn
stupid you are.

32:23.484 --> 32:25.319
You're only angry at me right
now because you know I'm right.

32:38.707 --> 32:39.832
I'm fine.

32:39.833 --> 32:41.417
You're clearly not okay.

32:41.418 --> 32:43.586
Okay, I was having
a moment, that's all!

32:43.587 --> 32:45.713
That was way more than
just a moment, Marielle!

32:45.714 --> 32:47.924
Okay, so, this place has
never gotten to you before?

32:47.925 --> 32:49.425
- Oh, my God!
- Really?

32:49.426 --> 32:51.552
You haven't just need a minute
to freak the fuck out?

32:51.553 --> 32:53.680
It is not a big deal.

32:53.681 --> 32:55.723
-  Mari!
- Just give it a rest, Kristi!

32:57.017 --> 32:58.142
Sorry.

32:58.143 --> 32:59.061
It's okay.

33:13.325 --> 33:16.369
Mari!

33:26.672 --> 33:29.257
Aah!

33:45.899 --> 33:48.401
What do you see?

33:48.402 --> 33:51.237
It's the people
from my hallucinations.

33:51.238 --> 33:53.072
Why are they here?

33:53.073 --> 33:54.825
Why were they
playing that song?

33:56.243 --> 33:57.703
You know why.

34:04.793 --> 34:06.420
They're all me.

34:09.757 --> 34:11.425
These were the lives
that I lived here.

34:15.053 --> 34:17.805
Some of them...
and many more.

34:17.806 --> 34:20.142
Look at them closely.
What do you see?

35:11.944 --> 35:14.321
None of them
are ripped apart.

35:17.282 --> 35:19.827
They weren't killed by the--
by the creatures in the woods!

35:21.787 --> 35:23.914
These men were murdered.

35:26.875 --> 35:27.793
By who?

35:29.503 --> 35:30.754
You know who.

35:35.300 --> 35:37.385
Minnows in a shark's net?

35:37.386 --> 35:38.804
What does that...

35:40.722 --> 35:43.140
Oh, my God.

35:43.141 --> 35:44.934
They were murdered
by the people in town.

35:44.935 --> 35:46.644
What?
Jade, who are you talking--

35:46.645 --> 35:48.145
Just-- gimme a--

35:48.146 --> 35:49.897
It's always the same.

35:49.898 --> 35:53.609
Once they learn the truth
about who you are,

35:53.610 --> 35:56.779
that it was you that
the children were calling for,

35:56.780 --> 35:58.573
first, they blame you,

35:58.574 --> 36:01.200
then, they hate you,

36:01.201 --> 36:02.744
eventually they kill you.

36:06.415 --> 36:07.624
And Tabitha?

36:09.167 --> 36:10.668
For Tabitha, it's worse.

36:10.669 --> 36:12.337
But, look...

36:15.257 --> 36:19.343
If I die every time...

36:19.344 --> 36:20.761
what are you saying?

36:20.762 --> 36:22.054
Are you saying
there's no way home?

36:22.055 --> 36:25.057
How--
How does this help?

36:25.058 --> 36:27.352
How do I stop it
from happening this time?

36:31.607 --> 36:32.899
Answer me!

36:32.900 --> 36:34.443
Jade. Hey, Jade. Jade.

36:41.575 --> 36:44.744
Okay,
let's back him up this way.

36:44.745 --> 36:46.203
Good?

36:46.204 --> 36:47.538
Ah!

36:47.539 --> 36:49.707
Okay.
Two, three.

36:50.751 --> 36:52.209
Okay.

36:54.046 --> 36:54.963
All right.

36:57.424 --> 36:59.508
Are you gonna be
all right, Victor?

36:59.509 --> 37:01.136
Yeah.
I'll take care of him.

37:10.354 --> 37:13.356
Hey, Victor.
What, uh...?

37:13.357 --> 37:14.900
What was he talking about?

37:27.746 --> 37:30.456
The man in
the yellow suit...

37:30.457 --> 37:32.084
ate my mother.

37:34.795 --> 37:37.047
But I never
should have told him.

37:59.111 --> 38:00.028
Hello?

38:04.866 --> 38:06.575
Where the hell did he go?

38:06.576 --> 38:09.578
Hey, can we just
take a minute here?

38:09.579 --> 38:11.122
Why the fuck
were you talking about

38:11.123 --> 38:12.332
people murdering you out there?

38:17.087 --> 38:18.046
Hey.

38:21.800 --> 38:23.051
Over here.

38:27.806 --> 38:28.807
Oh...

38:32.978 --> 38:35.605
What are we doing?
Why are we down here?

38:42.154 --> 38:43.071
Hey!

38:46.033 --> 38:47.783
- Hey!
-  Give me a hand!

38:47.784 --> 38:48.869
Give me a hand! Come on!

39:00.756 --> 39:02.215
Boyd...

39:03.842 --> 39:05.552
do you see a door
in that wall?

39:07.721 --> 39:08.930
Yup.

39:23.487 --> 39:25.446
Here you go.

39:25.447 --> 39:26.656
Thank you, Sophia.

39:36.291 --> 39:38.710
Can you try to tell us what
happened in the ambulance?

39:41.463 --> 39:42.547
Uh, the radio came on.

39:44.299 --> 39:46.843
Okay. And...?

39:48.637 --> 39:51.263
I heard them screaming.

39:51.264 --> 39:52.808
Who's-- Who's them?

39:54.184 --> 39:55.727
Everyone.

39:56.728 --> 39:59.688
Every single person
who's ever died here.

39:59.689 --> 40:04.110
That's what it was like for me
when we were in the chamber.

40:04.111 --> 40:07.488
All I could hear,
all I could feel was...

40:07.489 --> 40:10.450
the suffering of every single
person who has ever died here.

40:15.831 --> 40:17.790
I kept telling myself
it wasn't real,

40:17.791 --> 40:19.459
that it couldn't be.

40:20.710 --> 40:23.462
But when the radio came on,
it was like all that pain

40:23.463 --> 40:27.050
and horror just
shot through me again.

40:29.136 --> 40:30.679
You're a prophet.

40:34.141 --> 40:35.474
What?

40:35.475 --> 40:38.979
Maybe God has chosen you
to hear their suffering.

40:41.314 --> 40:43.107
Okay, I can't do this.

40:43.108 --> 40:44.567
- Mari...
-  No.

40:44.568 --> 40:46.610
Mari, wait.
Just...

40:46.611 --> 40:47.654
wait.

40:50.907 --> 40:53.034
I've seen this
happen here before.

40:54.619 --> 40:56.787
This place, it gets
in people's heads and--

40:56.788 --> 40:58.707
This is different, Kristi.

41:00.375 --> 41:03.127
There is something old here,

41:03.128 --> 41:05.881
something... ancient.

41:08.592 --> 41:11.344
And it's feeding off our
suffering and it doesn't stop.

41:12.971 --> 41:16.516
Even after we die,
we are still trapped here.

41:18.643 --> 41:20.312
And we never get to leave.

41:30.447 --> 41:33.824
Sometimes,
I forget he's just a kid.

41:33.825 --> 41:37.077
He's always
seemed so grown up.

41:37.078 --> 41:38.538
He's always been like that.

41:40.332 --> 41:42.834
Jim used to call him
the little professor.

41:44.461 --> 41:47.963
So, curious
and full of questions.

41:47.964 --> 41:50.174
Maybe he can figure out
what's in the goddamn lake.

41:50.175 --> 41:51.426
Stop it!

41:53.178 --> 41:54.554
Sorry.

41:56.014 --> 41:58.390
How much longer
till sunrise?

41:58.391 --> 42:00.769
Five minutes less than
the last time someone asked.

42:02.604 --> 42:04.605
Just try to get some sleep.

42:04.606 --> 42:06.982
You're joking, right?

42:06.983 --> 42:10.361
All we have to do
is hold on until the morning.

42:10.362 --> 42:12.112
Then, we can get
the hell outta here

42:12.113 --> 42:15.075
and back to
the nightmare we understand.

42:16.117 --> 42:17.993
We've got a long walk
in the morning, so--

42:26.169 --> 42:27.628
What the hell is that?

42:39.599 --> 42:40.976
Tabitha?

42:43.186 --> 42:46.231
I know that sound.

42:53.488 --> 42:54.989
The dolls...

42:54.990 --> 42:57.491
they were smaller.

42:57.492 --> 43:00.160
They were mine.
I was playing with them.

43:00.161 --> 43:01.161
What is she talking about?

43:01.162 --> 43:02.621
Shh, shh, shh.

43:02.622 --> 43:03.998
Mom?

43:03.999 --> 43:04.916
What else?

43:06.876 --> 43:08.420
A man; he was angry.

43:10.797 --> 43:12.298
He came and
took them from me.

43:12.299 --> 43:14.758
He said they
gave him nightmares,

43:14.759 --> 43:16.469
so he threw them in the lake.

43:20.390 --> 43:22.683
But one day,
the man died,

43:22.684 --> 43:26.478
and his nightmares...

43:26.479 --> 43:28.356
his nightmares
came out of the lake.

43:31.776 --> 43:33.193
Oh, my God, Donna,
we have to go.

43:33.194 --> 43:35.404
- We have to go right now.
- Tabitha, we can't.

43:35.405 --> 43:37.281
Donna! No, you don't understand!
You don't understand!

43:37.282 --> 43:38.741
We're not safe here!
We can't stay here.

43:38.742 --> 43:40.200
No, we have a
talisman on the door.

43:40.201 --> 43:42.578
No, no, no, talismen won't
protect us, not from this!

43:42.579 --> 43:44.913
How do you know that? How the
fuck do you know any of that?!

43:44.914 --> 43:45.832
Hey, hey, hey.

43:47.042 --> 43:49.418
Go! Go! Run!

43:49.419 --> 43:52.546
Go, go!
Come on, go!

43:52.547 --> 43:54.298
-  Ethan!
-  Go! Get out!

43:58.762 --> 44:01.096
Hey! Get off him!

44:14.152 --> 44:15.361
Donna!

44:15.362 --> 44:16.196
Ellis!

44:17.697 --> 44:19.198
Where's Patty?

44:19.199 --> 44:20.657
She-- She's not with you?

44:20.658 --> 44:21.992
No!

44:21.993 --> 44:23.327
Ah, shit!

44:23.328 --> 44:25.789
- Ellis!
- Donna, please!

44:37.008 --> 44:38.050
Mom!

44:38.051 --> 44:39.260
It's okay.

44:49.145 --> 44:51.063
No!

44:59.447 --> 45:01.031
Hey! Come on!

45:02.117 --> 45:04.618
We gotta go! Go!

45:07.622 --> 45:09.206
We have to run.

45:09.207 --> 45:11.083
No matter what happens,
we have to keep--

45:11.084 --> 45:12.167
Donna!

45:12.168 --> 45:13.293
- Donna!
- Donna!

45:13.294 --> 45:14.838
-  Donna, no!
-  Donna!

45:37.527 --> 45:38.778
Hey.

45:40.321 --> 45:41.947
Donna? You okay?

45:41.948 --> 45:43.867
Yeah. Yeah, yeah.

45:45.368 --> 45:47.953
Whoa!

45:47.954 --> 45:52.833
What just happened?

45:54.544 --> 45:56.712
I remembered.

45:56.713 --> 45:58.631
I remembered
how to hurt them.

46:59.192 --> 47:00.859
Oh, fucking...

47:00.860 --> 47:02.362
Oh, Jesus!

47:03.821 --> 47:05.532
Boyd!

47:09.702 --> 47:11.829
The fuck are you?

47:16.209 --> 47:17.210
Okay.

47:26.052 --> 47:27.470
What is this?

47:32.267 --> 47:33.935
Okay...

48:09.220 --> 48:10.096
Fuck.

48:11.639 --> 48:13.474
Boyd? Boyd?!

48:15.727 --> 48:17.102
Boyd?

48:17.103 --> 48:18.145
Aah!

48:18.146 --> 48:19.563
Shh! Hey! Shh!

48:19.564 --> 48:21.148
Hey, Jade,

48:21.149 --> 48:22.566
we have to go.

48:22.567 --> 48:24.818
We cannot be down here.

48:24.819 --> 48:26.778
But this isn't real!
This can't be real!

48:26.779 --> 48:27.779
- Jade!
- What?

48:27.780 --> 48:29.156
Listen to me.

48:29.157 --> 48:31.199
Capricorn. Okay?

48:31.200 --> 48:33.577
Capricorn.
This is real.

48:33.578 --> 48:37.247
You asked me to be your anchor,
so fucking listen to me.

48:37.248 --> 48:39.124
No, Boyd.
We're just in Colony House.

48:39.125 --> 48:40.459
The tunnels
aren't this close.

48:40.460 --> 48:41.960
Close?

48:41.961 --> 48:44.004
We've been walking down
that creepy hallway for--

48:44.005 --> 48:45.172
this stops now!

48:45.173 --> 48:46.214
Let's go.

48:46.215 --> 48:48.133
Okay. Okay.

48:48.134 --> 48:49.593
Okay. All right.

48:49.594 --> 48:51.011
- Hey!
- Huh?

48:51.012 --> 48:53.764
I will drag you outta here
if I fucking have to!

48:53.765 --> 48:55.767
Okay. All right. Okay.

49:16.496 --> 49:17.789
Oh...

49:23.878 --> 49:26.422
This is where
the children were sacrificed.

49:40.603 --> 49:42.105
How does knowing
that get us home?

49:47.026 --> 49:50.612
Tabitha and I,
we already tried to save them.

49:50.613 --> 49:52.906
We've tried so many times.

49:52.907 --> 49:55.200
Is it-- is it--
is there something here?

49:55.201 --> 49:58.036
Is there something,
something we need?

49:58.037 --> 50:00.540
Tell me how we save them
when we've already failed!

50:05.920 --> 50:07.839
Hi, Jade.

50:13.886 --> 50:15.345
You should have
listened to Boyd.

50:15.346 --> 50:16.722
No!

50:16.723 --> 50:18.391
But you were never really
the smart one, were you?

50:20.017 --> 50:21.978
Aah! Aah!

50:24.897 --> 50:27.190
No! No!
No, no, no, no!

50:27.191 --> 50:28.734
No, no, no!

50:28.735 --> 50:30.527
No! No!

50:32.488 --> 50:34.906
Get the fuck off of me!

50:42.039 --> 50:43.915
No, no!

50:43.916 --> 50:44.958
Get off!

50:44.959 --> 50:46.210
No!

50:47.920 --> 50:49.421
Anghkooey.

50:55.428 --> 50:57.804
Jade! Jade!
Hey, hey, hey! Oh!

50:57.805 --> 50:59.264
Oh, you okay?

50:59.265 --> 51:00.849
You okay?

51:00.850 --> 51:02.851
What the fuck
are we doing here?

51:02.852 --> 51:04.519
- What?
- How did we get here?

51:04.520 --> 51:06.396
What-- What? Hey.

51:06.397 --> 51:07.981
How the fuck
did we get here?!

51:07.982 --> 51:11.568
Jade, you never left.

51:11.569 --> 51:14.237
No, no, no.
We were in the tunnels.

51:14.238 --> 51:16.907
No, you've been
sitting here for hours.

51:16.908 --> 51:20.619
You were at the window...

51:20.620 --> 51:22.037
you sat down,

51:22.038 --> 51:24.039
and that's it.
You...

51:24.040 --> 51:27.375
No, no, no.
No, no.

51:27.376 --> 51:29.544
There was more. There was--

51:29.545 --> 51:30.963
There was a lot more.

51:36.385 --> 51:37.803
I know where they are.

51:37.804 --> 51:38.971
What?

51:42.809 --> 51:44.477
I know what we have
to do to go home.

51:46.521 --> 51:48.523
I know how we can
save the children.
